FAMECHECKER_DAISY.quote:
From: DAISY To: {PLAYER}

While I was comfortably enjoying my tea breaks, you've grown very skilled and powerful.

I hope you'll remain a good rival to my little brother.

FAMECHECKER_BROCK.quote:
From: BROCK To: {PLAYER}

In this big world of ours, there must be many tough TRAINERS.

Let's both keep training and making ourselves stronger!

FAMECHECKER_MISTY.quote:
From: MISTY To: {PLAYER}

I'm going to keep training here at this GYM.

When I get better, I'd love to hit the road and travel.

FAMECHECKER_KOGA.quote:
From: KOGA To: {PLAYER}

You and I, we must both set our sights higher and work towards meeting our challenges.

Now, I must go train my daughter.

FAMECHECKER_SABRINA.quote:
From: SABRINA To: {PLAYER}

The love you have towards your POKéMON…

It was a power that was never bested by my psychic power.

FAMECHECKER_BLAINE.quote:
From: BLAINE To: {PLAYER}

My fire POKéMON! They'll become even more powerful!

And now, a quiz. How many kinds of FIRE-type POKéMON are there?

FAMECHECKER_BRUNO.quote:
From: BRUNO To: {PLAYER}

The super power of your POKéMON and you I've experienced myself.

Next time, maybe I should show you how to train yourself.

FAMECHECKER_AGATHA.quote:
From: AGATHA To: {PLAYER}

When you grow older, don't you dare go soft like that coot OAK!

Be like me and keep battling on!

FAMECHECKER_MRFUJI.quote:
From: MR. FUJI To: {PLAYER}

Instead of hoping for the happiness of just your POKéMON…

…Can I get you to wish for the happiness of all POKéMON?

FAMECHECKER_GIOVANNI.quote:
From: GIOVANNI To: {PLAYER}

There is nothing that I wish to say to you.

I will concentrate solely on bettering myself, and none other.
